# Data lives outside git:
#  - fca.duckdb + extract_state.json are stored in the "warehouse" GitHub Release
#    (they outgrow git's 100 MB file limit); the daily workflow downloads/uploads them
#  - raw JSONL extracts are loaded into fca.duckdb, so they don't need keeping
